  {
   "text": "This is today's Item Shop for November 1st.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 2.285
  },
  {
   "text": "Three things before you spend a single V-Buck!",
   "t0": 2.415,
   "t1": 4.29
  },
  {
   "text": "The Beetlejuice Bundle:",
   "t0": 4.51,
   "t1": 5.45
  },
  {
   "text": "2,400 V-Bucks, instead of 5,300.",
   "t0": 5.515,
   "t1": 8.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Commando and Shadow Ops are in the shop.",
   "t0": 8.91,
   "t1": 10.75
  },
  {
   "text": "Both from Chapter 1, Season 1.",
   "t0": 10.86,
   "t1": 12.625
  },
  {
   "text": "And 14 skins are on their last day, eight of them Epic.",
   "t0": 12.885,
   "t1": 15.335
  },
  {
   "text": "Buying anything today?",
   "t0": 15.66,
   "t1": 16.536
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 16.596,
   "t1": 19.526
  },
  {
